#: ../../source/timsort_README.md:186
msgid ""
"`TimSort.sort` **is faster** than `array.sort` on almost of the tested "
"array types. In general, the more ordered the array is the better "
"`TimSort.sort` performs with respect to `array.sort` (up to 243 times "
"faster on already sorted arrays). And also, in general, the bigger the "
"array the more we benefit from using the `timsort` module."
msgstr ""

