#: ../../source/timsort_README.md:205
msgid ""
"TimSort is *stable* which means that equal items maintain their relative "
"order  after sorting. Stability is a desirable property for a sorting "
"algorithm.  Consider the following array of items with an height and a "
"weight."
msgstr ""

